<title>SOUTH KOREA: Samsung Corp to invest 10 trln won.</title>
<headline>Samsung Corp to invest 10 trln won.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Samsung Corp, a unit of the Samsung Group, said on Wednesday it would invest 10 trillion won by the year 2005 to exploit overseas resources, set up auto service centres and sales network, and to expand garment sales lines.  </p>
<p>A Samsung statement said the long-term plan was focused on generating 100 trillion won in sales and 1.5 trillion won in recurring profits in 2005.</p>
<p>Samsung Corp is divided into trading, construction, garment and auto sales divisions.</p>
<p>Further details were not given.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
